---
import SeoArticle from "../../components/SeoArticle.astro";
import { faq } from "./faq";
---

<SeoArticle idPrefix="m8-seo" {faq}>
  <section aria-labelledby="m8-seo-how">
    <h2 id="m8-seo-how" class="sd-text-title">How to ask the Magic 8 Ball</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>
        Think of a question and type it out… or just keep it in your head.
      </li>
      <li>
        Shake the ball. Press Shake, click the ball, drag it back and forth, or
        even shake your phone.
      </li>
      <li>Wait for your answer to reveal itself in the window.</li>
      <li>Share it as an image if you like.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      Keep in mind that yes or no questions work best, but even if the answer
      doesn't quite make sense, maybe you can find a way to make it work.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="m8-seo-writers">
    <h2 id="m8-seo-writers" class="sd-text-title">The writer's deck</h2>
    <p>
      Switch to the writer's deck for more writing-specific answers, such as
      "Kill that darling." and "Resubmit in triplicate.", for when the question
      is about the draft.
    </p>
  </section>
</SeoArticle>
